{"parentUuid":"4d19478e-ba31-456e-84b0-b87bdc5ce4f8","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"d7fd903f-4eab-4718-8a3d-1c392317615c","agentId":"a1c65c960a2f9cb0b","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01X8dS2mrNAkhVudAcTYihV5","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Laurent Perron CP-SAT long running infeasibility proof war stories\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"dblp: Laurent Perron\",\"url\":\"https://dblp.org/pid/73/4963.html\"},{\"title\":\"[Scheduling seminar] Laurent Perron (Google France) | The CP-SAT solver - YouTube\",\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vvUxusrUcpU\"},{\"title\":\"CP-SAT for scheduling Laurent Perron (lperron@google.com)\",\"url\":\"https://schedulingseminar.com/presentations/SchedulingSeminar_LaurentPerron.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"ViolationLS: Constraint-Based Local Search in CP-SAT | Integration of Constraint Programming, Artificial Intelligence, and Operations Research\",\"url\":\"https://dl.acm.org/doi/10.1007/978-3-031-60597-0_16\"},{\"title\":\"Monitor search in CP-SAT solver\",\"url\":\"https://groups.google.com/g/or-tools-discuss/c/r54A2eokoXk\"},{\"title\":\"OR-Tools Laurent Perron (lperron@google.com)\",\"url\":\"https://egon.cheme.cmu.edu/ewo/docs/CP-SAT%20and%20OR-Tools.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"CP-SAT: Infeasibility Subsolvers\",\"url\":\"https://groups.google.com/g/or-tools-discuss/c/Tz8ovW6cZtY\"},{\"title\":\"lperron (Laurent Perron) · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/lperron\"},{\"title\":\"Laurent PERRON | Tech Lead Operations Research | PhD Computer Science | Google Inc., Mountain View | Google | Research Department | Research profile\",\"url\":\"https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Laurent-Perron-2\"},{\"title\":\"Laurent Perron\",\"url\":\"https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=umrglaIAAAAJ&hl=en\"}]\n\nThe search results show information about Laurent Perron and his work on CP-SAT, but don't contain specific \"war stories\" about long-running infeasibility proofs. The results include references to his publications, talks, and discussions about CP-SAT capabilities, but not the specific anecdotes or case studies you're looking for.\n\nThe closest relevant result is from a Google Groups discussion about \"CP-SAT: Infeasibility Subsolvers,\" which discusses strategies for using CP-SAT to prove infeasibility, but this doesn't contain war stories or specific case studies about long-running proofs.\n\nIf you're looking for specific talks, blog posts, or articles where Laurent Perron discusses challenging infeasibility proof scenarios he's encountered with CP-SAT, they may not be easily indexed by search engines, or they might be in more technical forums, internal Google documentation, or presentations that aren't widely available online.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"228e0dd1-9cce-4f83-8626-ad6ac6967a7b","timestamp":"2026-05-07T20:30:13.625Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"4d19478e-ba31-456e-84b0-b87bdc5ce4f8","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
